---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Résumé"
	description="Résumé for Kyle DuPonte, Staff Data Scientist at Intuit, with a focus on FinTech and experimentation."
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20 md:px-12 md:py-28">
		<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-blue">Résumé</p>
		<h1 class="font-display mt-2 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-6xl">Staff Data Scientist, Intuit</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 max-w-[60ch] text-lg text-ink-soft">
			Full-stack data scientist with a background in FinTech experimentation, now growing into causal inference.
			For the career narrative, see the <a href="/about" class="text-accent-blue">About</a> page.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-10 max-w-prose border border-line p-6">
			<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-soft">[ Updated résumé available on request ]</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-base text-ink">
				I'm updating my résumé and would rather not have a stale PDF sitting here in the meantime. The fastest
				way to get the current one is a quick note on LinkedIn.
			</p>
			<a
				href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kyleduponte/"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent-blue px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-paper transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
			>
				Connect on LinkedIn
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
